msgstr "Optional: Specify a custom frontend page URL containing the BPMN modeler where learners should be redirected to continue tasks (e.g. https://your-site.com/bpmn-studio/). If empty, the plugin automatically resolves the latest published BPMN diagram or WordPress editor."

